msgid "comp7/deserter/cancel"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "comp7/deserter/message"
msgstr "This battle is not over yet. If you leave the battle before it ends, you will be letting down your team.\n{brown_open}Your rating will be reduced and you will be blocked from battles in this mode. {brown_close}\nAre you sure you want to leave the battle?"

